= Act One
== Scene: The Meeting
# {Maya} enters the {Last Library} at dawn, the atrium echoing with distant footsteps.
# {Maya} scans the mezzanine for {?Kai}, gripping the {Archivist Badge} concealed beneath her coat.
# A notice board lists restricted sections: the {Night District} is sealed after curfew.
# A page whispers: "Check the index vault," and {Maya} nods.
# {Maya} meets {?Kai} near the central catalog, exchanging a coded phrase.
# The pair agree to recover the lost index before {The Council} archives it forever.

@character Maya Chen: A persistent archivist with a knack for patterns
+aliases: Maya, Chen

@characters {
  - Last Library: The last public archive standing after the Flood
  - Kai Ito: A courier rumored to have Council connections
}

== Scene: The Interruption
# Bells toll. {Sentinel Guards} arrive to question visitors about missing folios.
# {Maya} distracts the guards while {?Kai} slips into a service stairwell.
# A hidden map behind shelf {C-17} shows a route to the index vault beneath the {Night District}.

= Act Two
== Scene: Descent
# {Maya} navigates service corridors, marking turns with chalk sigils.
# {?Kai} messages a single word on a scrap: "Diversion".
# The smell of ozone grows stronger near a humming grate; beneath it, the index vault thrums.
